      "message": "Hi Sir:\n\nWe don\u0027t want to be stuck in reclaim path of kswapd or direct_reclaim if rmap-lock contended in page_referenced_one or try_to_umap_one.\n\nSo we want to down_trylock instead of down_lock rmap-lock in the reclaim path, and if trylock failed, we will wakeup a kthread to reclaim them again so that kswapd and direct_reclaim wound not be stuck.\n\nWe had implemented in some way, such as adding the pages trylock filed to the head of lru-list, but it will caused the page old hard to be reclaim.\n\nSo we think that it is the best methods that wakeup a kthread to reclaim.\nPls accept export the func, thxs.",
